flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> O[Open Practice page]
    O --> C["Select category: Colour Recognition, Road Signs, Rules of the Road, or KEJARA & Safety"]
    C --> P[Select practice set]
    P --> I[/Display instructions/]
    I --> ST[Click Start Practice]
    ST --> A1((A))

    A2((A)) --> Q[/Display question/]
    Q --> AN{Answer this question?}
    AN -->|Yes| SA[Select answer A, B or C]
    SA --> FB[/Display feedback and explanation/]
    FB --> N{Learner action?}
    AN -->|No| N
    N -->|Next or Previous| Q
    N -->|Submit Practice| U{Unanswered questions?}
    U -->|Yes| CF{Submit anyway?}
    CF -->|No| Q
    CF -->|Yes| CS[Calculate score]
    U -->|No| CS
    CS --> SV[Save attempt to database]
    SV --> RS[/Display result/]
    RS --> RA{Result action?}
    RA -->|Review Answers| RV[/Display answer review/]
    RV --> E([End])
    RA -->|Try Again| Q
    RA -->|Next Set or Back to Practice| E
